// Task - Compound1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - OfficerOrbDialog 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page TaskOwnerPage Text :
"P2370138208" "<color orange>Only your task owner may speak to Officer Orb</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// Page AccessDeniedPage Text :
"P1520359380" "<color orange>Officer Orb cannot be spoken to until his captors are eliminated.</color>"
// Page OrbRescuedKatieGonePage Text :
"P3893685752" "So Seer 1381 didn't have the courage or wherewithal to see this through."
// Answer Text :
"P1026885760" "Don't worry, she's here. Just not 'here' here."
// Page OrbRescuedKatieUndeliveredPage Text :
"P3968854783" "Where is Seer 1381? I was hoping to verify her existence."
// Answer Text :
"P3224073197" "Right. Give me a minute."
// Page OrbOpeningPage Text :
"P827975466" "I will not yield to a known accomplice of Seer 1381. She is an enemy of the state, as are you by association."
// Answer Text :
"P436536364" "Then why bother speaking to me?"
// Page WhyBotherPage Text :
"P850104980" "<b>Sir.</b>"
// Answer Text :
"P542885946" "What?"
// Page SirPage Text :
"P1788159600" "'WHY ARE YOU BOTHERING TO SPEAK TO ME, <b>SIR</b>!' is what you meant to say. You <b>will</b> address me properly."
// Answer Text :
"P678525413" "That's not going to happen. Start talking."
// Page StartTalkingPage Text :
"P665620164" "It's classified."
// Answer Text :
"P3366235544" "Which part? ARCLIGHT? BETTERMOUSETRAP? What're you doing here?"
// Page ClassifiedPage Text :
"P3236139302" "All of it. Classified."
// Answer Text :
"P1333829831" "Even your failed mission?"
// Page DefinePage Text :
"P3721105198" "As far as I'm concerned, my mission to shut down the Seer Network is still in progress. By definition, that is not a failure."
// Answer Text :
"P3938976976" "You failed to remember it was classified."
// Page FailedToRememberPage Text :
"P1700369861" "...<br><br>You are correct. Therefore I am promoting you to Corporal now, which means you will also get executed if it is ever found out that I hastily gave up classified information. That makes enough circular sense for my thot-box...Corporal. "
// Answer Text :
"P1086933495" "If you say so. Now what happened at the Seer Network?"
// Page WhatHappenedPage Text :
"P1277784999" "Colonel Vargas, head of D.U.S.T. special operations in First Ward, found out that the Seer Network had been compromised. The Awakened had contaminated it for unknown reasons. Since I am naturally resistant to mind-control, I was promoted to command status of this cell, with orders to shut down the Seer Network with Red-level threat contingency bypass codes. The Awakened and the Apparitions in the facility were too strong. My cell withdrew to this fallback position to await further orders. Because of the Black Channel, no such orders will come. And, of course, my men have decided to ignore me, as you have seen."
// Answer Text :
"P3418567655" "They'll be executed. We're still on mission, Officer Orb."
// Page StillOnMissionPage Text :
"P3503869166" "I have not forgotten that your association with Seer 1381 makes you a war criminal. And I know she would be valuable in this mission. I am granting her a temporary stay of execution. You, Corporal, may be given a pardon, however, if we succeed. And we <b>will</b> succeed."
// Answer Text :
"P367532782" "Right. We'll meet you at the Seer Network."
// Page SeeYouTherePage Text :
"P1995400554" "'We will see you there, <b>sir</b>.' Remember your station, Corporal."
// Answer Text :
"P2385719541" "(Leave)"
// Page Fallback Text :
"P1482999907" "Something is wrong."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P402659777" "First things first: this is going to be pretty morbid. I won't speak for <i>you</i>, but I don't much like it.<br><br>Each one of the possessed D.U.S.T. Rangers in the FFZ had some kind of persona defense training, right? Right. And we <i>both</i> know that particularly strong individuals that <i>are</i> possessed retain a bit of their personalities even when they're serving as a host body to an Apparition. Soooo...<br><br>...it stands to reason that any given possessed D.U.S.T. Ranger retains, at the very least, some idea of where he was at, what he was doing, what his orders he had at the time were, et cetera et cetera, just before he was all <i>bodysnatched.</i>  If we collate enough of this data, we could make a good estimation of where to go next. Following me? Good. <i>Now. Here's the tricky bit.</i><br><br><color orange>I need to scan the minds of a few D.U.S.T. Rangers at the <i>moment</i> you separate their host body from the Apparition.</color> You're going to have to get your hands bloody, because there's only one surefire cure for possession. You <i>know</i> what I'm asking. Deal with your conscience in whatever way fits you best afterwards, but I'm going to have to scan a few before I can start building us the Big Picture. You up for this, killer?"
// AcceptString :
"P4037093513" "I'll only go after the officers. It's doubtful that the grunts will know enough."
// SendOffString :
"P2912623015" "Huh, I didn't think of that. Good idea.<br><br><color orange>Get me into enough of their minds and I can triangulate our next likely step.</color><br><br>And, yeah, I just said 'triangulate' without blinking. So sue me. Won't happen again.<br><br>Get moving. We'll hook back up when I've got us a location."
// TaskTitle :
"P1153987940" "<color deepskyblue>Black Channel Protocols</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P3501278729" "<color deepskyblue>Part One: Top Men</color>"

