"P2751016864" "<t=3 caption x= 0.3 y=0.7 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>Okay, it's just up ahead.<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.7 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>And it's being protected by Apparitions. Great. Take them out first and then I'll teleport in."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P118447931" "<t=3 caption x= 0.3 y=0.7 d=3><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>Okay, I 'ported into one of the Network nodes....<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.7 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>From inside here, I shouldn't need any bypass codes. I can just take a good look around. Watch my back, guys."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P51671725" "<t=2 caption x= 0.3 y=0.7 d=2><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>Uh oh....<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.7 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>There's something INSIDE the Seer Network! I mean, besides ME!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P563924565" "<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.7 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>The whole Network is full of Apparitions! I can't stop them!<t=4 caption x= 0.7 y=0.7 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>They're... swimming into my head!<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.7 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>Listen carefully: I'm going to shut this thing down and get out of here, but I'm going to bring a few of them with me.<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.7 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>Don't be surprised if I don't recognize you. And seriously? One, don't take it personally. Two, try not to kill me, like, TOO much."

