"P1458842880" "Take up flanking positions and move out!<t 0.01>"
// Script Variable SayOnArrival :
"P1924960291" "A textbook inflitration! Commendations for everyone, except for Seer 1381!<t 2>"
// Script Variable SayOnRecapture :
"P2096431857" "D.U.S.T. Commanding Officer to Corporal: converge on my position. Over.<t 0.01>"
// Script Variable SayOnRerescue :
"P4090911699" "Remember the mission, Corporal!<t 0.01>"
// Script Variable SayOnStranded :
"P1401733276" "Corporal, stay in formation!<t 0.01>"
// Script Variable RescueObjectiveText :
"P1091962005" "Rendezvous with Officer Orb"
// Script Variable LeadToObjectiveText :
"P2166178315" "Lead Officer Orb to the Seer Network controls"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2383867661" "Inform Seer 1381 the LZ is clear and for her to doubletime her arrival.<t 0.01>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3794242201" "<t 4><t 2>Corporal, I order you to execute all enemies desginated as 'Awakened'. Make me proud!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3655737708" "We're halfway there. Eyes sharp, soldier! You don't want to end up like the brave, fallen, and genetically-altered personnel we've come across.<t 0.01>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P687428280" "<t 5><t 4>She's telesending again, isn't she? You don't give the orders here, Seer 1381, I do. Corporal, remove any enemies from the LZ! No mistakes!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2280035676" "<t 9><t 3>Think faster, Seer 1381, we've got a war to win!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P839126897" "<t 8><t 4>This is quite unorthodox, Seer 1381. I will relay as much in your pre-execution circus trial."
