// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - ScriptDurayDefeated 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P59337174" "Defeat Colonel Duray"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2079939393" "<t=3 caption x= 0.3 y=0.7 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>Hmm, I'm not reading Vargas anywhere.<t=3 caption x= 0.7 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>He's either possessed or...yeah, I'm bettin' on possessed."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1047259178" "<t=3 caption x= 0.7 y=0.7 d=3><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>Orrr...he's dead. Easy mistake.<t 0.01>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3802463667" "<t=3 caption x= 0.3 y=0.7 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>Okay, we can use that comm array to get what we need.<t=3 caption x= 0.7 y=0.7 d=3><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>Careful in here. Something weird is going to happen."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1413470166" "<t=3 caption x= 0.2 y=0.5 d=3><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>'Recovery Team', huh? Yeah, right.<t 0.01>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3410086318" "<t=3 caption x= 0.3 y=0.7 d=3><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>He's going to talk us to death.<t 0.01>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1568228058" "<t=3 caption x= 0.3 y=0.7 d=3><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>COME ON, ORB! WE'VE GOT A TIMER RUNNING!<t 0.01>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1611392153" "<t=3 caption x= 0.2 y=0.5 d=3><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>Saw that one coming.<t 0.01>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P130104446" "<t=5 caption x= 0.3 y=0.7 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>Okay, you've got access to the back of the facility. That's where the data archives are.<t 0.01>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3148016726" "<t=5 caption x= 0.7 y=0.7 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>The IDF just blew up the comm array remotely. We need to hurry. They'll be here any second.<t 0.01>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2302649957" "<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>They're here! Don't let them get their hands on the data archives!<t 0.01>"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P3974497299" "<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.7 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>And there's our boy. Duray's thoughts are pretty dang loud. He's mad that he even had to come here.<t=4 caption x= 0.2 y=0.5 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>He'll chase you down for the data you have, unless you simply make it not worth his while.<t=4 caption x= 0.3 y=0.7 d=4><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor FireBrick>My advice? Give Duray a good reason to bug outta here. Like knocking his face in."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P167746340" "<t 3><t 1>Hello, Corporal. You've read the orders.<t 4>With Vargas dead, I am acting CO of D-SEC. This is now an IDF operation, do you understand me?<t 4>We will sit tight and wait for the IDF Recovery Team like good soldiers. We WILL not tamper or ATTEMPT to tamper with the Data Archives deeper in the facility.<t 3>That's an order.<t 1>Several orders.<t 1>Lots and lots and lots of orders.<t 5>Thot-box cycling: likelihood of you conforming to said orders.< t 1>Zero.<t 3>Very well, I am passing sentence: {HeroName}, you are accused of aiding and abetting the criminal, Seer 1381.<t 3>Thot-box cycling: reaching verdict."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P1873914938" "Death by plasma!<t 0.01>"

